# Create Application

The Application is the entry point only. It boots and configures the shell.

## Keep here

- bootstrap and launch flow
- first model selection
- stage title, icons, and shell configuration
- scene customization and global CSS

## Keep out

- business logic
- feature orchestration
- controller-style event code
- backend access

## Key API

- extend `DefaultApplication<StackPane>` (or the chosen root pane type).
- choose the entry model in `firstModelClass()`.
- set the title in `applicationTitle()`.
- add global stylesheets in `customizeScene(scene)` with `addCSS(scene, SomeStyles.DEFAULT)`.
- tune the window in `customizeStage(stage)`.
- list preloaded resources in `getResourceToPreload()`.

Template: `templates/ApplicationTemplate.java.txt`.
